[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10688.63, "timestamp": "02:58:08", "text": "是的。好了，给你。我已将……寄给你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10691.11, "timestamp": "02:58:11", "text": "所以，按压光束一，而不是光束二。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10693.269, "timestamp": "02:58:13", "text": "青金石。我就是青金石。我会读的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10708.11, "timestamp": "02:58:28", "text": "它。揍那个傻瓜"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10710.95, "timestamp": "02:58:30", "text": "你。好了，我们知道接下来该怎么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10716.429, "timestamp": "02:58:36", "text": "你知道，因为我会感到孤立无援。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10719.67, "timestamp": "02:58:39", "text": "耶。嗯，乔斯需要了解一下这件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10725.469, "timestamp": "02:58:45", "text": "这不算什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10727.91, "timestamp": "02:58:47", "text": "这个游戏真漂亮。看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10730.23, "timestamp": "02:58:50", "text": "就是这样。是的。每次我看"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10735.11, "timestamp": "02:58:55", "text": "就这么办。该死。拥抱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10738.79, "timestamp": "02:58:58", "text": "拥抱。嗯，我就从……开始。"}]